[2026.08.16-23.40.05:426][  0]LogVoxelEarth: VoxelSky ATMOSPHERE DOME SHOWN (voxel.Sky.AtmosphereDome=1, materialValid=1 -> resolved 1). SHOWN means THIS MESH paints the sky and the SkyAtmosphere's full-screen pass does not (View.bSceneHasSkyMaterial goes true, SkyAtmosphereRendering.cpp:2214); HIDDEN hands the sky back to that pass. The two must agree to within 2/255 of mean luma at every hour -- that is the whole of phase S1, and this line is what tells a capture which arm it is.
